# Use events from another API

Add the API as a project dependency, run `trellis update`, then select the event in the participant:

```trellis
participant acme.orders-service@v1 service {
  implements acme.orders@v1;
  use auth required api trellis.auth@v1 {
    events subscribe = ["Connections.Opened"];
  }
}
```

`trellis generate` emits the selected descriptor and records the exact referenced API digest in the participant artifact.
